cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "Pre-Immune Window of Monolayer Neoplasia — simulation code and run data"
authors:
  - family-names: "Dmitrochenko"
    given-names: "Y."
    name-suffix: "M.D."
  - family-names: "Demi"
    given-names: "S. L."
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-29"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Agent-based simulation of a monolayer epithelium used to test whether resource
  regulation alone prevents the establishment of a reverted clone, and what changes
  when an independent oxygen filter is added. Contains the engine, the batch runners
  and the complete run data (2500 runs) behind Chapters 1, 2 and 4 of the paper.
